WEBVTT

00:07.862 --> 00:09.137
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.206 --> 00:10.827
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.896 --> 00:12.310
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.379 --> 00:14.275
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.344 --> 00:17.310
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.379 --> 00:19.413
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.482 --> 00:21.413
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.482 --> 00:23.310
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.379 --> 00:25.000
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.068 --> 00:27.448
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.517 --> 00:29.413
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.482 --> 00:31.379
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.448 --> 00:33.413
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.482 --> 00:35.275
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.344 --> 00:37.413
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.482 --> 00:39.517
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.586 --> 00:40.862
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.931 --> 00:42.724
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.793 --> 00:45.448
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.517 --> 00:47.758
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.827 --> 00:49.413
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:49.586 --> 00:53.517
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:53.586 --> 01:00.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:03.413 --> 01:06.275
- All right, Krusty crew,
listen up.
- 好吧，Krusty 船员，
听着。

01:06.344 --> 01:09.275
Last night's buy one
get one full price
昨晚买了一个
获得一份全价

01:09.344 --> 01:11.689
Krabby Patty sale went great!
蟹黄饼促销非常顺利！

01:11.758 --> 01:15.586
But the crowds left me
restaurant dirtier than usual.
但人群却离我而去
餐厅比平时更脏。

01:15.655 --> 01:17.931
Mm.
毫米。

01:18.000 --> 01:18.931
- Hey.
- 嘿。

01:19.000 --> 01:20.758
- Eeeh.
- 呃。

01:20.827 --> 01:22.034
So I'm gonna need you
所以我需要你

01:22.103 --> 01:25.275
to clean until
this whole place sparkles!
清洁直到
这整个地方都闪闪发光！

01:25.344 --> 01:29.137
- Ooh, you've got it, Mr. K.
- 哦，你明白了，K 先生。

01:29.206 --> 01:30.793
Whoa.
哇哦。

01:30.862 --> 01:33.137
Ooh.
哦。

01:33.206 --> 01:35.344
- Hey.
- 嘿。

01:39.000 --> 01:41.931
- Ugh.
- 呃。

01:42.000 --> 01:43.517
[gasps]
[喘气]

01:48.551 --> 01:51.586
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:03.413 --> 02:06.413
- SpongeBob, are you
all done cleaning?
- 海绵宝宝，你是吗
都打扫完了吗？

02:06.482 --> 02:09.724
- Oh, just finishing up now,
Mr. Krabs.
- 哦，现在刚刚结束，
蟹老板。

02:12.551 --> 02:15.241
- This place looks great!
- 这个地方看起来很棒！

02:15.310 --> 02:16.896
Well done, lad.
干得好，小伙子。

02:16.965 --> 02:18.517
All right, time
to get back to cooking.
好吧，时间到了
回去做饭。

02:18.586 --> 02:19.379
Huh?
啊？

02:19.448 --> 02:20.689
Oh, where's the grill?
哦，烤架在哪里？

02:20.758 --> 02:23.482
- Oh, I took it outside
to air dry.
- 哦，我把它带到外面了
风干。

02:23.551 --> 02:25.551
See?
看？

02:25.620 --> 02:27.172
- Hmm.
- 唔。

02:28.827 --> 02:31.206
See what?
看到什么？

02:31.275 --> 02:33.482
- The grill.
It's right here.
- 烧烤架。
就在这里。

02:33.551 --> 02:35.793
- Right here where?
- 就在这里哪里？

02:35.862 --> 02:37.724
- Under my arm, silly.
- 在我胳膊下，傻瓜。

02:37.793 --> 02:39.137
- The grill is gone.
- 烤架不见了。

02:39.206 --> 02:41.827
- [laughs]
The grill is gone.
- [笑]
烤架不见了。

02:41.896 --> 02:45.482
The grill is gone!
烤架没了！

02:45.551 --> 02:47.551
[screams]
The grill is gone!
[尖叫声]
烤架没了！

02:47.620 --> 02:49.103
The grill is gone!
The grill is gone!
烤架没了！
烤架没了！

02:49.172 --> 02:51.068
The grill is gone!
The grill is gone!
烤架没了！
烤架没了！

02:51.137 --> 02:54.068
[screams]
[尖叫声]

02:54.137 --> 02:58.655
[breathing heavily]
[呼吸粗重]

02:58.724 --> 02:59.965
Grill gone.
烧烤架不见了。

03:00.034 --> 03:01.551
The grill gone.
烤架不见了。

03:01.620 --> 03:04.896
Oh, look, it must be
the grill's trail.
哦，你看，一定是
烧烤架的踪迹。

03:06.827 --> 03:07.931
Ah.
啊。

03:08.000 --> 03:10.379
There's still
some grease flavor here.
还有
这里有些油脂味。

03:10.448 --> 03:11.827
Come on, Mr. Krabs,
来吧，蟹老板，

03:11.896 --> 03:14.310
I'll taste the trail
all the way to the grill.
我会品尝那条路
一直到烤架。

03:14.379 --> 03:17.586
- Um, we could
just use our eyes, boyo.
- 嗯，我们可以
只要用我们的眼睛，男孩。

03:17.655 --> 03:20.000
- Oh, great idea,
Mr. Krabs.
-哦，好主意，
蟹老板。

03:22.965 --> 03:25.379
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

03:34.068 --> 03:37.551
- Look, Mr. Krabs,
a race boat garage.
- 看，蟹老板先生，
赛艇车库。

03:37.620 --> 03:40.068
But what would a garage
need a grill for?
但车库会怎样
需要烤架吗？

03:40.137 --> 03:42.241
Huh?
Hmm.
啊？
唔。

03:44.275 --> 03:46.482
- This ain't
no garage.
- 这不是
没有车库。

03:46.551 --> 03:47.931
This here's a clubhouse
这是一个俱乐部会所

03:48.000 --> 03:51.000
for local ragamuffins,
urchins, and waifs.
对于当地的衣衫褴褛的人来说，
海胆和流浪儿。

03:51.068 --> 03:53.241
Look, and there's me grill.
看，这就是我的烧烤炉。

03:53.310 --> 03:55.965
- What are they doing
to it, Mr. Krabs?
- 他们在做什么
螃蟹先生？

03:56.034 --> 03:57.206
- Whoa.
- 哇哦。

03:57.275 --> 03:59.241
- Cool.
- 凉爽的。

03:59.310 --> 04:00.724
- Whoa.
- 哇哦。

04:00.793 --> 04:01.827
- Whoop.
- 哎呀。

04:01.896 --> 04:03.965
- Ah, no!
- 啊，不！

04:04.034 --> 04:06.034
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

04:06.103 --> 04:10.034
- Why, why?
- 为什么，为什么？

04:10.103 --> 04:11.931
[drill whirs]
[钻头呼呼地响]

04:12.000 --> 04:14.172
- [laughs]
- [笑]

04:14.241 --> 04:16.448
- No, not
the cooking surface!
- 不，不
烹饪表面！

04:16.517 --> 04:18.344
That's where
all the flavor is!
那就是那里
所有的味道都是！

04:18.413 --> 04:19.793
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

04:19.862 --> 04:20.896
- SpongeBob, zip it.
- 海绵宝宝，拉上拉链。

04:20.965 --> 04:22.344
- Ooh, thanks.
- 哦，谢谢。

04:22.413 --> 04:23.827
You know, not every friend'll
tell you when you--
你知道，不是每个朋友都会
告诉你，当你——

04:23.896 --> 04:25.344
- You stay here.
- 你留在这里。

04:25.413 --> 04:27.137
I'm gonna get
me grill back.
我会得到
我烤回来。

04:27.206 --> 04:28.551
- But how, Mr. Krabs?
- 但是怎么样呢，蟹老板？

04:28.620 --> 04:31.000
- Don't worry, boyo,
they're just kids.
- 别担心，男孩，
他们只是孩子。

04:31.068 --> 04:33.896
They have
to listen to me.
他们有
听我说。

04:37.034 --> 04:38.206
Hello, children.
哈喽，孩子们。

04:38.275 --> 04:40.310
I'm an adult.
我是成年人了。

04:40.379 --> 04:42.241
This here is me grill,
这是我的烧烤架，

04:42.310 --> 04:44.379
so I'll just be
taking it back now.
所以我就这样
现在把它收回来。

04:44.448 --> 04:47.206
- Hey, what do you think
you're doing, mister?
- 嘿，你觉得怎么样
你在做什么，先生？

04:47.275 --> 04:49.137
That's our racing cart.
这就是我们的赛车。

04:49.206 --> 04:50.827
- Racing cart?
- 赛车？

04:50.896 --> 04:52.448
That's no "racing cart."
那不是“赛车”。

04:52.517 --> 04:56.379
That there is a top-of-the-line
Grill King 3000,
有一个顶级的
烧烤王3000，

04:56.448 --> 04:58.586
and it belongs to me.
它属于我。

04:58.655 --> 05:02.379
See? I brought all
the relevant paperwork.
看？我全都带来了
相关文件。

05:02.448 --> 05:06.068
- This looks like homework.
- 这看起来像家庭作业。

05:06.137 --> 05:09.344
We don't take kindly
to homework around here.
我们不善待
在这里做作业。

05:09.413 --> 05:10.379
- Yeah.
- 是的。

05:10.448 --> 05:12.413
- Homework stinks.
- 作业很臭。

05:17.862 --> 05:19.103
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

05:19.172 --> 05:23.655
- I think you just wanna
steal our racing cart.
- 我想你只是想
偷我们的赛车。

05:23.724 --> 05:26.862
- I can't steal
something I already own.
- 我不能偷东西
我已经拥有的东西。

05:26.931 --> 05:27.896
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:27.965 --> 05:31.034
That's it.
Out of me way, you imps.
就是这样。
别挡我的路，你这个小鬼。

05:31.103 --> 05:32.551
Grown up coming through.
长大了就过去了。

05:32.620 --> 05:35.172
- Hold your sea horses,
old man.
- 握住你的海马，
老头儿。

05:35.241 --> 05:36.482
[clicks tongue]
[咔嚓舌头]

05:37.482 --> 05:39.379
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

05:39.448 --> 05:41.517
[sea horse whinnies]
[海马嘶嘶声]

05:43.344 --> 05:45.758
- [snarls]
- [咆哮]

05:46.379 --> 05:48.344
- Whoa!
- 哇！

05:48.413 --> 05:50.275
Heh, that's it?
呵呵，就这样吧？

05:50.344 --> 05:52.068
Your little kiddie
trap doesn't--
你的小宝贝
陷阱不——

05:52.137 --> 05:53.758
Ah!
啊!

05:53.827 --> 05:56.068
[laughter]
[笑声]

05:56.137 --> 05:58.103
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

05:58.172 --> 05:59.931
Mr. Krabs, you okay?
蟹老板，你还好吗？

06:00.000 --> 06:02.931
- [gibberish]
- [胡言乱语]

06:03.000 --> 06:05.379
- Let me try talking
to them, Mr. Krabs.
- 让我试着说话
对他们来说，蟹老板。

06:05.448 --> 06:06.758
I think
I can reach them.
我认为
我可以联系到他们。

06:06.827 --> 06:09.379
After all,
I have something you don't:
毕竟，
我有你没有的东西：

06:09.448 --> 06:11.586
the heart of a child.
一颗孩子的心。

06:11.655 --> 06:13.931
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

06:16.137 --> 06:18.448
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

06:18.517 --> 06:21.620
Yeah, not a bad little cart
you guys have built.
是啊，不错的小推车
你们已经建造了。

06:21.689 --> 06:24.275
- Oh, gee, mister,
you think so?
- 噢，天啊，先生，
你这么认为吗？

06:24.344 --> 06:28.103
- Mm-hmm, too bad
it looks so slow.
- 嗯嗯，太糟糕了
看起来好慢。

06:28.172 --> 06:29.448
all: Huh?
全体：啊？

06:29.517 --> 06:32.448
- Yep, no way this thing
could beat our cart,
- 是的，这件事不可能
可以打败我们的购物车，

06:32.517 --> 06:34.965
not in a million years.
一百万年内不会。

06:35.034 --> 06:38.034
- Our cart is the fastest
in Bikini Bottom.
- 我们的购物车是最快的
在比基尼底部。

06:38.103 --> 06:39.379
both: The fastest!
两人：最快！

06:39.448 --> 06:40.689
- Oh, really?
- 哦真的吗？

06:40.758 --> 06:42.931
If only there was
some way to prove it.
如果有的话
某种方式来证明这一点。

06:43.000 --> 06:44.724
- How's about
a race, then?
- 怎么样
那么比赛呢？

06:44.793 --> 06:46.310
- How's about the winner
of the race
- 获胜者怎么样
比赛的

06:46.379 --> 06:48.482
gets to keep
the loser's racing cart?
得到保留
失败者的赛车？

06:48.551 --> 06:50.862
- How's about it's on?
- 开着怎么样？

06:50.931 --> 06:54.862
See you tomorrow morning
at the top of Murder Hill.
明天早上见
在谋杀山顶。

06:56.034 --> 06:58.448
- What do you think
you're doing, boyo?
- 你觉得怎么样
你在做什么，男孩？

06:58.517 --> 07:00.379
We don't have a racing cart.
我们没有赛车。

07:00.448 --> 07:01.896
- Of course we do,
Mr. Krabs.
- 我们当然知道，
蟹老板。

07:01.965 --> 07:04.068
There's just some
assembly required.
只是有一些
需要组装。

07:04.137 --> 07:05.586
Oh!
哦！

07:07.689 --> 07:09.586
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

07:11.724 --> 07:14.137
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

07:14.206 --> 07:16.551
- You sure we built
this thing right?
- 你确定我们建造了
这件事对吗？

07:16.620 --> 07:19.172
It looks a little funky.
它看起来有点时髦。

07:19.241 --> 07:20.310
- Well, what do you mean?
- 嗯，你什么意思？

07:20.379 --> 07:22.551
We followed my blueprint.
我们遵循我的蓝图。

07:22.620 --> 07:24.965
Besides, there's nothing
to worry about.
除此之外，什么也没有
担心。

07:25.034 --> 07:27.689
We just have to make it
through one quick race
我们只需要做到
通过一场快速比赛

07:27.758 --> 07:29.862
down a teensy weensy little
下来一个很小的小

07:29.931 --> 07:34.310
deadly, steep, utterly
terrifying hill.
致命的、陡峭的、完全的
可怕的山。

07:34.379 --> 07:36.448
[gasps]
[喘气]

07:36.517 --> 07:39.241
[pterodactyls caw]
[翼手龙的叫声]

07:39.310 --> 07:40.241
[gulps]
[吞咽]

07:40.310 --> 07:41.586
[laughter]
[笑声]

07:41.655 --> 07:44.068
- Ha, you call that
a racing cart?
- 哈，你管这个叫
赛车？

07:44.137 --> 07:47.896
Looks more like the slow boat
to Palookaville.
看起来更像是慢船
到帕卢卡维尔。

07:47.965 --> 07:50.034
[laughter]
[笑声]

07:50.103 --> 07:53.482
- It's on,
you whippersnappers.
- 已开启，
你们这些自命不凡的人。

07:55.517 --> 07:57.793
Plankton,
what are you doing here?
浮游生物，
你在这里做什么？

07:57.862 --> 08:00.448
- When I heard your grill
was on the line,
- 当我听到你的烧烤声时
正在上线，

08:00.517 --> 08:02.241
I had to get in on this race.
我必须参加这场比赛。

08:02.310 --> 08:05.379
If there's even one little
smudge of patty on there,
如果哪怕有一点点
那里有肉饼的污迹，

08:05.448 --> 08:07.310
the formula will be mine.
公式将是我的。

08:07.379 --> 08:08.896
[chuckles]
[笑声]

08:11.517 --> 08:12.931
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

08:13.000 --> 08:14.413
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

08:14.482 --> 08:16.310
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

08:19.379 --> 08:22.413
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:22.482 --> 08:24.310
Barnacles.
藤壶。

08:29.310 --> 08:31.827
- Whoa!
- 哇！

08:34.689 --> 08:35.931
- Ah, huh?
- 啊，啊？

08:36.000 --> 08:37.965
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:38.034 --> 08:39.275
[groans]
[呻吟]

08:41.241 --> 08:42.689
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

08:43.517 --> 08:44.448
- Oh.
- 哦。

08:44.517 --> 08:45.620
- Haha, take that!
- 哈哈，拿走吧！

08:45.689 --> 08:47.827
- Watch it, you hooligan!
- 小心点，你这个流氓！

08:47.896 --> 08:50.206
- [laughs]
- [groans]
- [笑]
- [呻吟]

08:51.482 --> 08:53.275
SpongeBob, look out!
海绵宝宝，小心！

08:54.724 --> 08:59.275
- Ah, whoa, yeow!
- 啊，哇，哟！

09:00.482 --> 09:02.620
[loud crash]
[巨响]

09:14.586 --> 09:15.758
[all laugh]
[全都笑]

09:15.827 --> 09:17.689
- Mr. Krabs,
the steering's out.
- 蟹老板先生，
方向盘坏了。

09:17.758 --> 09:18.724
They cut our brakes.
他们切断了我们的刹车。

09:18.793 --> 09:20.172
What do we do?
我们该怎么办？

09:20.241 --> 09:22.793
- Uh, oh, uh, maybe
we should call their parents?
- 呃，哦，呃，也许
我们应该打电话给他们的父母吗？

09:22.862 --> 09:24.413
- No, Mr. Krabs.
- 不，蟹老板。

09:24.482 --> 09:27.275
You can't win a kids' game
by thinking like an adult.
你不可能赢得儿童游戏
像成年人一样思考。

09:27.344 --> 09:29.172
You have to think young.
你必须年轻地思考。

09:29.241 --> 09:30.413
- You're right, boyo.
- 你是对的，男孩。

09:30.482 --> 09:33.551
We have to delve deep
back into me childhood.
我们必须深入研究
回到我的童年。

09:33.620 --> 09:35.689
[crying]
[哭泣]

09:35.758 --> 09:38.172
- Too far back, Mr. Krabs.
Too far.
- 太落后了，蟹老板。
太远了。

09:38.241 --> 09:39.793
- Oh, oh, oh,
yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
- 哦，哦，哦，
是啊，是啊，是啊，是啊。

09:39.862 --> 09:41.413
Check this out.
看看这个。

09:41.482 --> 09:45.827
I learned it in me old
Wormtown skating days.
我在老的时候就学会了
沃姆敦滑冰日。

09:45.896 --> 09:48.413
- Whoa, Mr. Krabs,
I didn't know you could shred.
- 哇哦，蟹老板先生，
我不知道你能撕碎。

09:48.482 --> 09:51.655
- Whoo, hey.
- 呼，嘿。

09:51.724 --> 09:55.172
I got a plan!
Hold on!
我有一个计划！
坚持，稍等！

10:01.241 --> 10:03.172
Plug 'em in, boyo.
把它们插上，男孩。

10:05.689 --> 10:07.310
- Oh.
- 哦。

10:07.379 --> 10:10.965
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:11.034 --> 10:12.482
- Come on, SpongeBob.
- 来吧，海绵宝宝。

10:12.551 --> 10:13.689
What's the holdup?
有什么阻碍？

10:13.758 --> 10:15.172
- Sorry, Mr. Krabs.
- 对不起，蟹老板。

10:15.241 --> 10:17.103
My hands get clammy
when I'm defying death.
我的手变得湿冷
当我反抗死亡的时候。

10:17.172 --> 10:18.103
See?
看？

10:18.172 --> 10:19.103
♪ Ta-da ♪
♪ 达达 ♪

10:19.172 --> 10:20.379
[laughs]
[笑]

10:21.448 --> 10:23.241
- Enough magic tricks.
- 足够的魔术。

10:23.310 --> 10:24.310
Plug 'em in!
插入它们！

10:24.379 --> 10:26.620
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:26.689 --> 10:28.689
- Yeah!
- 是的！

10:28.758 --> 10:31.310
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

10:31.379 --> 10:35.241
all: Oh, oh, ow, ow, ow!
全体：哦哦哦哦哦哦！

10:35.310 --> 10:37.379
Whoa!
哇！

10:37.448 --> 10:38.689
Oh.
哦。

10:38.758 --> 10:40.068
- Ah.
- 啊。

10:40.137 --> 10:41.206
Huh?
啊？

10:41.275 --> 10:42.586
Mmm.
嗯。

10:42.655 --> 10:44.793
- Yay, the finish line!
- 耶，终点线！

10:44.862 --> 10:47.000
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

10:47.068 --> 10:48.344
Huh? Ugh.
啊？啊。

10:48.413 --> 10:50.655
- [laughs]
- [笑]

10:50.724 --> 10:51.689
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:51.758 --> 10:54.586
[loud crash]
[巨响]

10:54.655 --> 10:57.000
[shudders]
I won.
[颤抖]
我赢了。

10:58.517 --> 11:02.310
And so after some quick
thinking and fancy racerin',
所以经过一些快速的
思考和幻想赛车，

11:02.379 --> 11:03.862
I won me grill back.
我把烧烤赢回来了。

11:03.931 --> 11:05.862
I looked those kids
in the eye and said,
我看着那些孩子
看着他的眼睛说道：

11:05.931 --> 11:08.310
"I own these streets.
“我拥有这些街道。

11:08.379 --> 11:12.413
"Don't come back to me
restaurant ever again...
“别回到我身边
餐厅再次...

11:12.482 --> 11:15.206
Until you have money."
直到你有钱为止。”

11:15.275 --> 11:17.000
Adults rule!
大人统治！

11:17.068 --> 11:18.241
[laughs]
[笑]

11:18.310 --> 11:21.379
[laughter]
[笑声]

11:21.448 --> 11:22.413
[loud crashing]
[巨响]

11:22.482 --> 11:23.862
Hey, what's going on?
嘿，发生什么事了？

11:23.931 --> 11:27.103
- Whoa, let's see 'em
beat us this time.
- 哇，让我们看看他们
这次打败了我们。

11:27.172 --> 11:28.586
[whistles]
[口哨声]

11:28.655 --> 11:31.241
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

11:31.310 --> 11:32.896
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

11:32.965 --> 11:36.172
- Here we go cart again!
- 我们又来推车了！

11:36.241 --> 11:37.275
[laughs]
[笑]

11:37.344 --> 11:38.827
- Zip it, boyo.
- 拉上拉链，男孩。

11:38.896 --> 11:40.620
- Oh, thanks, Mr. Krabs.
- 哦，谢谢，蟹老板。

11:40.689 --> 11:42.275
Not everybody'll
tell you when--
不是每个人都会
告诉你什么时候——

11:46.137 --> 11:48.724
[mysterious music]
[神秘的音乐]

11:48.793 --> 11:54.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:54.413 --> 11:57.551
[people cheering]
[人们欢呼]

11:57.620 --> 11:59.275
- Beat it, we're closed!
- 别这样，我们关门了！

11:59.344 --> 12:01.413
- Whoa.
- 哇哦。

12:01.482 --> 12:03.275
Whoa, there
is nothing better
哇，那里
没有什么比这更好的了

12:03.344 --> 12:05.862
than spending 18 hours
at Glove World,
比花18小时
在手套世界，

12:05.931 --> 12:08.655
even if my feet
are a bit tired.
即使我的脚
有点累了。

12:08.724 --> 12:11.517
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

12:11.586 --> 12:14.137
- Mine are hungry.
- 我的饿了。

12:14.206 --> 12:16.275
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

12:16.344 --> 12:17.758
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

12:17.827 --> 12:21.172
Too bad the Krusty Krab
doesn't stay open this late.
可惜了蟹堡王
这么晚都不开门。

12:21.241 --> 12:23.448
- Of course it does!
- 当然可以！

12:23.517 --> 12:25.896
See?
看？

12:25.965 --> 12:27.172
- Huh?
- 啊？

12:27.241 --> 12:29.931
Mr. Krabs never mentioned
we had a night shift.
蟹老板从未提及
我们上夜班。

12:33.448 --> 12:35.379
Huh?
啊？

12:35.448 --> 12:38.206
all: Patrick!
全体：帕特里克！

12:38.275 --> 12:40.379
- Hi, guys!
- 嗨，大家好！

12:40.448 --> 12:42.379
- You sure are popular.
- 你确实很受欢迎。

12:42.448 --> 12:46.379
- I come here
every night.
- 我来这里
每个晚上。

12:46.448 --> 12:47.793
- Blech.
- 布莱赫。

12:47.862 --> 12:49.793
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

12:50.620 --> 12:54.172
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

12:54.241 --> 12:55.689
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

12:55.758 --> 12:56.931
Hi, Patrick.
嗨，帕特里克。

12:57.000 --> 12:59.068
- Long time
no see, man.
- 很长时间
没看见，伙计。

12:59.137 --> 13:01.172
- Hi, Jennifer.
Hi, Chuck.
- 嗨，詹妮弗。
嗨，查克。

13:01.241 --> 13:02.862
- [slurps]
- [啜饮]

13:02.931 --> 13:06.482
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

13:06.551 --> 13:07.689
Oh, oh!
哦，哦！

13:07.758 --> 13:09.241
- Good evening.
- 晚上好。

13:09.310 --> 13:10.344
- Whoa.
- 哇哦。

13:10.413 --> 13:12.275
- Amuse-bouche,
sir?
- 开胃小菜，
先生？

13:12.344 --> 13:15.344
Isopod fillets sprinkled with
polyps on a bed of seagrass,
等足类鱼片撒上
海草床上的息肉，

13:15.413 --> 13:19.448
drizzled with coral slime
and just a soupçon of algae.
淋上珊瑚粘液
和一碗藻类汤。

13:19.517 --> 13:20.551
[pops]
[流行音乐]

13:20.620 --> 13:23.310
- Don't mind if I do.
- 如果我这样做的话，请不要介意。

13:23.379 --> 13:24.379
Mmm.
嗯。

13:24.448 --> 13:28.379
Mmm, mmm, not bad.
嗯嗯，还不错。

13:28.448 --> 13:29.827
[passes gas]
- Eee.
[放气]
- 呃。

13:29.896 --> 13:32.206
- Pardon me.
- 请原谅我。

13:34.517 --> 13:36.241
- Oh, hey.
- 哦，嘿。

13:36.310 --> 13:38.724
- Sorry, buddy.
- 对不起，伙计。

13:40.655 --> 13:44.689
- The night shift certainly
attracts a different crowd.
- 当然是夜班
吸引了不同的人群。

13:44.758 --> 13:46.137
- Come over here,
SpongeBob.
- 过来这里，
海绵宝宝。

13:46.206 --> 13:48.000
I want you
to meet someone.
我想要你
去见某人。

13:48.068 --> 13:50.965
SpongeBob,
this is Squidabeth.
海绵宝宝，
这是斯奎达贝斯。

13:51.034 --> 13:53.620
- Huh?
- 啊？

13:53.689 --> 13:56.413
- Good to meet you,
Mr. Bob.
- 很高兴认识你，
鲍勃先生。

13:58.551 --> 14:00.137
- Oh, a pleasure,
mademoiselle.
- 哦，很高兴，
小姐。

14:00.206 --> 14:03.413
- [giggles]
Ain't you a little charmer?
- [咯咯笑]
你是不是一个小魅力？

14:03.482 --> 14:07.103
- [laughs]
Yeah, I am.
- [笑]
是的，我是。

14:07.172 --> 14:09.000
- What you fixin' to have,
honey child?
- 你想要什么，
亲爱的孩子？

14:09.068 --> 14:10.965
- One Krabby Patty, please.
- 请来一份蟹肉饼。

14:11.034 --> 14:12.310
- A Krabby what?
- 蟹蟹什么？

14:12.379 --> 14:14.034
We ain't got
none of those, hon.
我们没有
这些都不是，亲爱的。

14:14.103 --> 14:17.241
- You don't serve
Krabby Patties?
- 你不服务
蟹肉饼？

14:17.310 --> 14:20.172
- But we got lots
of other tasty vittles.
- 但我们有很多
其他美味的食物。

14:20.241 --> 14:23.413
- "Howling rings,
sucker shakes,
-“嚎叫声响起，
吸盘摇晃，

14:23.482 --> 14:25.620
boo-gers, crawly fries"?
鼻屎、爬行薯条”？

14:25.689 --> 14:27.275
- Give us the works!
- 给我们作品！

14:27.344 --> 14:30.379
- One great Pacific
garbage patch!
- 一个伟大的太平洋
垃圾补丁！

14:30.448 --> 14:31.965
- Order up!
- 订购吧！

14:32.034 --> 14:33.655
- Oh, boy, oh, boy,
oh, boy.
- 哦，男孩，哦，男孩，
哦，男孩。

14:33.724 --> 14:36.379
You gotta try
a sucker shake.
你必须尝试
摇晃得很厉害。

14:36.448 --> 14:39.482
[slurping]
[发出声音]

14:44.551 --> 14:46.413
Ah, drink up, buddy.
啊，喝点酒吧，伙计。

14:46.482 --> 14:48.344
- I'm--
[babbles]
- 我是--
[胡言乱语]

14:50.758 --> 14:51.724
- Yum.
- 嗯。

14:51.793 --> 14:53.103
- [grumbling]
- [抱怨]

14:53.172 --> 14:56.896
- The howling rings
are a scream.
- 嚎叫声
是一声尖叫。

14:56.965 --> 14:58.448
- [howls]
- [嚎叫]

14:58.517 --> 15:01.620
[both howling]
[两人都嚎叫]

15:03.310 --> 15:06.000
- A little different,
but I like it.
- 有点不同，
但我喜欢它。

15:06.068 --> 15:07.931
Give the chef
my compliments.
给厨师
我的赞美。

15:08.000 --> 15:10.689
- Why, tell him
yourself, sweetie.
- 为什么，告诉他
你自己，亲爱的。

15:10.758 --> 15:12.655
You got a visitor!
有客人来了！

15:12.724 --> 15:14.137
- Come on back!
- 回来吧！

15:16.275 --> 15:19.000
Hey there, night feeders.
嘿，夜间喂食者。

15:19.068 --> 15:21.517
Name's Barry Blobfish.
我的名字是巴里·水滴鱼。

15:21.586 --> 15:22.793
Good to know ya.
很高兴认识你。

15:22.862 --> 15:23.965
- Good to meet you, Barry.
- 很高兴认识你，巴里。

15:24.034 --> 15:25.379
I'm SpongeBob.
我是海绵宝宝。

15:25.448 --> 15:28.931
- Yikes!
- 哎呀！

15:29.000 --> 15:31.586
Oh, that's
my cooking hand.
哦，那是
我的做饭手。

15:31.655 --> 15:33.655
- Oh, sorry.
- 哦，抱歉。

15:33.724 --> 15:34.793
Used my spatula arm.
用了我的抹刀臂。

15:34.862 --> 15:36.482
[grunts]
[咕哝]

15:36.551 --> 15:38.310
[loud rumbling]
[巨响]

15:38.379 --> 15:40.655
- Night train!
- 夜行列车！

15:40.724 --> 15:43.862
[train whistle blows]
[火车鸣笛]

15:48.482 --> 15:50.517
- Oh, no,
the midnight rush.
- 哦，不，
午夜高峰。

15:50.586 --> 15:51.965
What am I gonna do?
我要做什么？

15:52.034 --> 15:55.275
Oh, if only there was
a fry cook in the house.
哦，如果有的话就好了
家里有一个炒菜的厨师。

15:55.344 --> 15:59.379
- Oh, I'm a certified
fry cook!
- 哦，我是经过认证的
炒菜做饭！

15:59.448 --> 16:00.724
- Oh, let's see.
- 哦，让我们看看。

16:00.793 --> 16:02.241
I'd have to clear it
with the night manager.
我必须清除它
和夜班经理。

16:02.310 --> 16:05.103
Hey, boss,
can this little fella here
嘿，老板，
这个小家伙可以在这里吗

16:05.172 --> 16:06.965
take over
my shift tonight?
接管
今晚我值班吗？

16:07.034 --> 16:11.103
[creepy music]
[令人毛骨悚然的音乐]

16:11.172 --> 16:12.827
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

16:12.896 --> 16:14.758
- Nosferatu?
- 诺斯费拉图？

16:14.827 --> 16:16.758
Oh.
哦。

16:16.827 --> 16:18.655
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

16:18.724 --> 16:20.793
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

16:20.862 --> 16:22.827
[slurps]
[啜饮]

16:22.896 --> 16:25.689
[belches]
[打嗝]

16:25.758 --> 16:27.379
- You got the job, kid.
- 你得到了这份工作，孩子。

16:27.448 --> 16:28.689
- Hooray!
- 万岁！

16:28.758 --> 16:29.862
- Whew.
- 呼。

16:29.931 --> 16:31.862
Now I can pass out
in peace.
现在我可以昏倒了
平静地。

16:31.931 --> 16:34.068
[groans]
[呻吟]

16:34.137 --> 16:37.000
- Invisible Stan,
let's get him to a hospital.
- 隐形斯坦，
我们送他去医院吧。

16:37.068 --> 16:39.172
Wounded fry cook
coming through!
受伤的炒菜厨师
来了！

16:39.241 --> 16:40.793
- Hey, get
your grill in gear.
- 嘿，得到
你的烤架已启动。

16:40.862 --> 16:42.448
The crowd's getting restless.
人群变得焦躁起来。

16:42.517 --> 16:44.724
- Uh, yes, ma'am.
- 呃，是的，女士。

16:44.793 --> 16:46.896
Oh, oh, oh, oh, yeah.
哦，哦，哦，哦，是的。

16:46.965 --> 16:49.068
They are gonna
love this.
他们要
喜欢这个。

16:50.103 --> 16:52.206
[all grumbling]
[大家都在抱怨]

16:52.275 --> 16:55.137
Here, try a sample
from the daytime menu.
在这里，尝试一下示例
从白天的菜单中。

16:58.965 --> 17:02.034
Whee, whoa.
哇哦。

17:02.103 --> 17:03.931
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

17:04.000 --> 17:06.689
[all eating noisily]
[大家都吵吵嚷嚷地吃东西]

17:07.896 --> 17:08.862
- Bleh.
- 布莱赫。

17:08.931 --> 17:10.620
- Blah.
- 废话。

17:10.689 --> 17:12.896
- [gags]
- [笑声]

17:12.965 --> 17:14.793
Bleh.
布莱赫。

17:14.862 --> 17:16.172
- Bleh.
- 布莱赫。

17:16.241 --> 17:19.448
[all vomiting]
[全都呕吐]

17:21.172 --> 17:23.379
- What the devilfish
did you make?
- 什么魔鬼鱼
你做了吗？

17:23.448 --> 17:24.931
- Well, Krabby Patties,
of course.
- 好吧，蟹肉饼，
当然。

17:25.000 --> 17:26.931
- [gags]
- [笑声]

17:27.000 --> 17:29.655
You tryin' to poison us?
你想毒害我们吗？

17:31.827 --> 17:35.862
Quit fooling around
and cook up something edible.
别再胡闹了
并煮一些可以吃的东西。

17:35.931 --> 17:37.517
- Oh.
- 哦。

17:37.586 --> 17:38.862
Whoa.
哇哦。

17:38.931 --> 17:40.862
That's impossible.
那是不可能的。

17:40.931 --> 17:43.379
Everyone loves
Krabby Patties.
每个人都喜欢
蟹肉饼。

17:43.448 --> 17:46.827
What kind of a weird
upside-down place is this?
什么样的怪异
这是颠倒的地方吗？

17:46.896 --> 17:50.137
- And no more
of that daytime slop!
- 不再有
那个白天的泥水！

17:50.206 --> 17:53.275
- Krabby Patties aren't slop.
- 蟹黄饼不潦草。

17:55.551 --> 17:57.896
Got to be something
they like in here.
必须是某种东西
他们喜欢在这里。

17:57.965 --> 17:59.620
No.
不。

17:59.689 --> 18:01.344
No.
不。

18:01.413 --> 18:03.068
No.
不。

18:03.137 --> 18:05.344
No.
不。

18:05.413 --> 18:06.620
No.
不。

18:06.689 --> 18:07.862
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

18:07.931 --> 18:08.862
Huh?
啊？

18:08.931 --> 18:10.448
Oh, no!
哦，不！

18:10.517 --> 18:12.206
[screams]
[尖叫声]

18:15.931 --> 18:18.724
- Oh, now, lookie here.
- 哦，现在，看这里。

18:18.793 --> 18:20.103
Night patties!
晚上吃肉饼！

18:20.172 --> 18:21.862
Now you're getting
the swing of it.
现在你得到了
它的摆动。

18:21.931 --> 18:23.896
- N-N-Night patties?
- N-N-Night 肉饼？

18:23.965 --> 18:25.931
- Order up, people!
- 订购吧，人们！

18:26.000 --> 18:28.034
- All right,
night patties.
- 好吧，
晚上肉饼。

18:28.103 --> 18:29.482
- Tasty.
- 好吃。

18:29.551 --> 18:31.206
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

18:31.275 --> 18:33.034
[ghosts whimper]
[鬼魂呜咽]

18:33.103 --> 18:34.655
Smooth.
光滑的。

18:35.344 --> 18:38.413
[ghost whimpers]
[幽灵呜咽]

18:41.965 --> 18:43.724
- Ah.
- 啊。

18:43.793 --> 18:46.724
[ghosts whimper]
[鬼魂呜咽]

18:46.793 --> 18:48.448
Smoky.
烟。

18:48.517 --> 18:50.068
- Hooray!
- 万岁！

18:50.137 --> 18:51.586
- Yeah!
- 是的！

18:51.655 --> 18:53.413
- Hooray!
- 万岁！

19:01.413 --> 19:03.896
- Everybody down
on the floor.
- 大家都下来
在地板上。

19:03.965 --> 19:06.068
- It's the Fisherman!
- 这是渔夫！

19:06.137 --> 19:07.931
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

19:08.000 --> 19:10.551
both: No,
not the Fisherman!
两者：不，
不是渔夫！

19:10.620 --> 19:12.896
- Now hand over the moola.
- 现在交出钱。

19:12.965 --> 19:16.793
[all whimpering]
[全都呜咽]

19:16.862 --> 19:18.275
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

19:23.103 --> 19:24.379
- Well, good evening, sir.
- 嗯，晚上好，先生。

19:24.448 --> 19:25.724
Welcome to
the Krusty Krab.
欢迎来到
蟹堡王。

19:25.793 --> 19:27.379
- Give me all your money!
- 把你所有的钱都给我！

19:27.448 --> 19:29.517
- Well, always glad to help
a fellow out with a loan.
- 嗯，总是很乐意提供帮助
一个借钱出去的人

19:29.586 --> 19:32.241
- Loan?
I don't want a loan.
- 贷款？
我不想贷款。

19:32.310 --> 19:33.758
I'm the Fisherman.
我是渔夫。

19:33.827 --> 19:35.241
I'm robbing the place.
我要抢地方了

19:35.310 --> 19:38.275
- Well, that
is downright unfriendly.
- 嗯，那个
是彻头彻尾的不友好。

19:38.344 --> 19:40.827
I'm putting you under
fry cook's arrest.
我把你放在下面
弗莱厨师被捕。

19:40.896 --> 19:42.517
- Huh?
- 啊？

19:42.586 --> 19:44.965
Oh, really?
哦真的吗？

19:45.034 --> 19:46.206
[laughs]
[笑]

19:46.275 --> 19:47.379
- Whoa!
- 哇！

19:47.448 --> 19:50.275
Ooh, oh!
哦哦！

19:50.344 --> 19:52.793
Ah, oh, oh, oh, oh, yeek!
啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！

19:52.862 --> 19:54.068
[groaning]
[呻吟]

19:54.137 --> 19:55.137
- I got you now.
- 我现在找到你了。

19:55.206 --> 19:57.275
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

19:58.034 --> 20:01.068
Not so fast.
没那么快。

20:01.137 --> 20:02.655
- Whoa, uh.
- 哇，呃。

20:02.724 --> 20:04.724
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

20:04.793 --> 20:06.034
Yee ah!
呀呀！

20:06.103 --> 20:07.034
Waa!
哇！

20:07.103 --> 20:08.862
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

20:08.931 --> 20:10.620
Wha, oh!
哇哦！

20:10.689 --> 20:14.655
- Well, looks like the hook
is on the other fin now, huh?
- 嗯，看起来像钩子
现在在另一个鳍上，是吧？

20:14.724 --> 20:17.206
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

20:18.448 --> 20:19.620
- Don't worry, my friends.
- 别担心，我的朋友们。

20:19.689 --> 20:21.862
I have captured
the evil doer.
我已捕获
恶人。

20:21.931 --> 20:24.482
- Hey, leave him alone!
- 嘿，别管他了！

20:24.551 --> 20:28.137
- Just what do you
think you're doing?
- 你到底要做什么
你觉得你在做什么？

20:28.206 --> 20:30.724
- Uh, catching a criminal.
- 呃，抓罪犯。

20:30.793 --> 20:32.241
- He's no criminal.
- 他不是罪犯。

20:32.310 --> 20:33.827
He works here.
他在这里工作。

20:33.896 --> 20:35.482
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

20:35.551 --> 20:37.068
- He robs us every night.
- 他每晚都会抢劫我们。

20:37.137 --> 20:38.931
- It's a night shift
tradition.
- 这是夜班
传统。

20:39.000 --> 20:41.413
- Oh, a night shift tradition.
- 哦，夜班传统。

20:41.482 --> 20:43.103
[clears throat]
Heh, heh, oops.
[清嗓子]
嘿嘿嘿，哎呀。

20:43.172 --> 20:46.241
Sorry about that,
Mr. Fisherman, sir.
对此感到抱歉，
渔夫先生，先生。

20:47.551 --> 20:48.689
Oy.
哎哟。

20:48.758 --> 20:51.517
- No worries,
little yellow thing.
- 不用担心，
黄色的小东西。

20:51.586 --> 20:53.965
You got some
mean fishing skills.
你有一些
意思是钓鱼技巧。

20:54.034 --> 20:55.172
Respect.
尊重。

20:55.241 --> 20:56.413
- Oh.
[giggles]
- 哦。
[咯咯笑]

20:56.482 --> 20:58.758
You're not so bad
yourself.
你没那么坏
你自己。

20:58.827 --> 20:59.758
Oh, yow!
哦，哟！

20:59.827 --> 21:01.448
- Attention,
- 注意力，

21:01.517 --> 21:04.172
let's welcome our newest member
of the night shift.
让我们欢迎我们的最新成员
夜班的。

21:04.241 --> 21:05.517
What's your name again?
你又叫什么名字？

21:05.586 --> 21:07.931
- [whispers]
SpongeBob SquarePants.
- [低语]
海绵宝宝。

21:08.000 --> 21:09.344
- SquareBob SpongePants.
- SquareBob 海绵裤。

21:09.413 --> 21:10.793
- Okay, close enough.
- 好吧，足够接近了。

21:10.862 --> 21:13.034
- A round of night patties
for everyone!
- 一轮夜间肉饼
对于每个人！

21:13.103 --> 21:14.620
I'm buying!
我买！

21:14.689 --> 21:17.241
[all cheer]
[大家欢呼]

21:18.103 --> 21:19.862
[foghorn blares]
[雾号声]

21:21.724 --> 21:23.275
- Quittin' time!
- 下班时间到了！

21:23.344 --> 21:25.413
- Oh, already?
- 哦，已经？

21:28.655 --> 21:30.000
- I'm back.
- 我回来了。

21:30.068 --> 21:31.344
- Barry!
- 巴里！

21:31.413 --> 21:33.206
- Thanks for helping out,
SpongeBob.
- 感谢您的帮助，
海绵宝宝。

21:33.275 --> 21:34.413
- Oh, it was nothing.
- 哦，没什么。

21:34.482 --> 21:37.034
Oh, I'm gonna
miss you guys.
哦，我要
想念你们。

21:37.103 --> 21:38.517
[all laugh]
[全都笑]

21:38.586 --> 21:41.137
- Come and visit us
again soon, honey.
- 来拜访我们
很快就会再来一次，亲爱的。

21:41.206 --> 21:44.275
- We're here
every night.
- 我们在这里
每个晚上。

21:46.862 --> 21:49.758
- Huh, huh, huh?
- 哈，哈，哈？

21:49.827 --> 21:51.724
- What are you doing here
so early, boyo?
- 你在这里做什么
这么早啊，小子？

21:51.793 --> 21:54.448
- Oh, I was helping out
on the night shift.
-哦，我正在帮忙
上夜班。

21:54.517 --> 21:56.241
- Night shift, hmm?
- 夜班，嗯？

21:56.310 --> 21:58.310
We don't have
a night shift.
我们没有
夜班。

21:58.379 --> 22:00.965
Hmm, must have been
a bad dream, kiddo.
嗯，一定是
一个噩梦，孩子。

22:01.034 --> 22:02.310
- Huh?
- 啊？

22:02.379 --> 22:05.482
Gee, guess I must
have been sleep-working.
哎呀，我想我必须
一直在睡觉工作。

22:05.551 --> 22:07.896
- Well, I ain't
sleep-paying you,
- 嗯，我不是
睡眠支付你，

22:07.965 --> 22:10.758
so get to wakey-working.
所以开始清醒工作吧。

22:10.827 --> 22:12.275
- Yes, sir.
- 是的，先生。

22:12.344 --> 22:13.689
[sighs]
[叹气]

22:13.758 --> 22:15.310
Yow!
哟！

22:15.379 --> 22:17.000
A fish hook?
鱼钩？

22:18.103 --> 22:21.482
- Case history of a fry cook
who wanted a late night snack
- 一位油炸厨师的案例
谁想吃夜宵

22:21.551 --> 22:24.586
but ended up
in the fry vat of doubt.
但最终
在怀疑的鱼缸里。

22:24.655 --> 22:26.206
Mr. SquarePants
will never know
方裤先生
永远不会知道

22:26.275 --> 22:30.379
he has worked a shift
in "The Tidal Zone."
他轮班了
在《潮汐区》中。

22:30.448 --> 22:31.862
[train whistle blows]
[火车鸣笛]

22:31.931 --> 22:35.310
- I'd like five night patties
to go, please.
- 我想要五个夜间肉饼
请走吧。

- 我想要五个夜间肉饼
请走吧。